= Ferguson

A police shooting in Ferguson, Missouri, has ignited protests across the country. Images of armored vehicles on American streets stun the nation. Our coalition is united in grief and divided in tactics.

- @ferguson_reform: Champion police reform
- @ferguson_calm: Call for calm and dialogue
- @ferguson_order: Emphasize public order

@ferguson_reform
on-arrival: minority_dem += 4*(1-dissent); young_dem += 2*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent -= 3; local_police_loyalty -= 0.03; polarization += 1

We back body cameras, accountability, and community policing.

@ferguson_calm
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); minority_dem += 1*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 3; polarization -= 0.5

We appeal for calm and dialogue. Some activists feel patronized.

@ferguson_order
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 3*(1-dissent); working_dem += 1*(1-dissent); minority_dem -= 3*(1-dissent); progressive_dissent += 6; directleft_strength += 5

We stress that violence helps no one. Our base is angry.
